== pitboard vault
Where parked logins are kept: in the login keychain

Usage: pitboard vault [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  status  Say where parked logins are kept (the default)
  move    Move every parked login to another way of keeping them, which macOS does not offer
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json
          Print JSON instead of text

  -h, --help
          Print help

== pitboard vault status
Say where parked logins are kept (the default)

Usage: pitboard vault status [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json
          Print JSON instead of text

  -h, --help
          Print help

== pitboard vault move
Move every parked login to another way of keeping them, which macOS does not offer

Usage: pitboard vault move [OPTIONS] <FORM>

Arguments:
  <FORM>
          Where to keep them
          
          [possible values: secret-service, files]

Options:
      --json
          Print JSON instead of text

  -h, --help
          Print help

